{
  "note": "Keys the OIDC provider accepts at generate time although they are inconsistent: the JWKS publishes the key's own public part (JWK x/y or n/e, the certificate's key), tokens are signed with the private part and verified against the public one; an EC key off the algorithm's curve fails in generateJWK.",
